        </h2>
      </div>
      <div className='font-normal text-sm leading-relaxed'>
        <div>Drive wheel: {capitalizeFirstLetter(car.driven_wheels)}</div>
        <div>
          Engine: V{car.engine_cylinders} / {car.engine_hp} horsepower
        </div>
        <div>
          Transmission type:{' '}
